  "check": "python3 -c \"import hashlib;print(hashlib.sha256(b'2025|ARI|3|14|0|355|488').hexdigest())\"",
  "note": "This example row is published so the hashing recipe can be tested. It is the only row whose values appear here, and it is one line of a public standings table reproduced for the sole purpose of demonstrating the verification method; it is not used as data anywhere in the pipeline."
